.TH SDL_GetScancodeFromName 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetScancodeFromName \- Get a scancode from a human-readable name.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_keyboard.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_Scancode SDL_GetScancodeFromName(const char *name);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I name
the human-readable scancode name\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the
.BR SDL_Scancode ,
or
.BR SDL_SCANCODE_UNKNOWN
if the name wasn\(aqt recognized; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
